120: \centering
121: \caption{Test conditions and mean drag coefficients. Uncertainties are one standard deviation of the values across the ten conditions; $u(C_D)$ is the propagated per-run uncertainty from Eq.~\eqref{eq:unc}.}
122: \label{tab:summary}
